426v10.583H5.629V3.426Zm0 0"/></g></g></svg></a></div></header><main class="main main--post"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles/main.css"><article class="post"><header class="hero post__header"><div class="wrapper wrapper--narrow"><ol class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/"><span>Home</span></a></li><li><span>&rsaquo;</span> <a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/drift/" title="Drift"><span>Drift</span></a></li></ol><h1 class="post__title">Drift Hunters Pro</h1><div class="post__meta"><div class="post__author">By <a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/" class="invert" title="OnlineGames.io">OnlineGames.io</a></div><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/drift-hunters-pro/#comments" aria-label="Comments" rel="nofollow" class="post__comments invert"><svg><use xlink:href="https://www.onlinegames.io/assets/svg/svg-map.svg#comments"/></svg></a></div></div></header><div class="gameContent" id="gameContentDiv"><div class="hero"><div class="wrapper"><center><p><iframe id="gameFrame" width="1060" height="650" src="https://www.onlinegames.io/games/2023/unity/drift-hunters-pro/index.html" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" frameborder="0" scrolling="no" webkitallowfullscreen="webkitallowfullscreen" mozallowfullscreen="mozallowfullscreen" msallowfullscreen="true" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></p></center></div></div></div><div class="wrapper main__content post__inner"><div class="post__entry"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><div class="wp-block-column"><figure class="post__image post__image--center"><img loading="lazy" src="https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/Drift-Hunters-Pro.webp" alt="Drift Hunters Pro Controls" width="750" height="224" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw" srcset="https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-xs.webp 384w, https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-sm.webp 600w, https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-md.webp 768w, https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-lg.webp 1200w"></figure><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Can you hear the engine moaning? </span><strong>Drift Hunters Pro</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> is a thrilling 3D game with high-quality graphics for those who are fond of drifting &amp; racing. You can play solely, or you can play on the servers with other players. In this game, you have 6 different tracks and 10 upgradable vehicles in the garage that you can buy with earnings via drifting. Enjoy the tire track!</span></p><h2><strong>How to Play Drift Hunters Pro?</strong></h2><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use WASD or the Arrow keys to direct the vehicle</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use the Space key as the handbrake</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use C to change the camera view</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use R for resetting the vehicle</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use U to change KMH &gt; MPH</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use I for starting or stopping the engine</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use P for Full Screen</span></li></ul><h2><strong>Garage</strong></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In the Garage menu, you have 10 different types of vehicles. As you earn rewards while drifting, in the meantime, you are unlocking a new car. Plus, you can modify your vehicle as you wish! Paint them aesthetically, upgrade the cars, adjust the tunings, choose your wheels. Head over to our blog post to learn <a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/full-guide-drift-hunters/">how to choose a car for drifting</a>.</span></p><h2><strong>Upgrading the Vehicles</strong></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use your car in its entirety! The more you strengthen the vehicle, the more efficiency you will get from it. As mentioned in the Garage section, you can upgrade your vehicle's features. These features involve:</span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Engine</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Turbo</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Gearbox</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Handling</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Weight</span></li></ul><h2><strong>Tuning Up</strong></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Along with upgrading, you can modify your vehicle physically. You can adjust the following:</span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Front Height</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rear Height</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Front Camber</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rear Camber</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Turbo Pressure</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Brake Balance</span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Brake Pressure</span></li></ul><h2><strong>Tricks &amp; Tips for Drift Hunters Pro</strong></h2><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The more you hold the vehicle drifting, the more points you take. In order to do that, you can choose some specific tracks like the racetrack or the highway. They enable you to drift around the corners freely. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">To sail perfectly in the long run, you can tune up and upgrade your vehicle in the Garage menu to get the maximum slide. </span></li></ul><h2><strong>Can I play Drift Hunters Pro with my friends?</strong></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes, you can play Drift Hunters Pro with multiplayer mode on OnlineGames.io. Create a room by selecting the multiplayer mode after hitting the play button on the main menu. Enjoy the ride together with your friends.</span></p><h2><strong>Similar Games</strong></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you like this game, browse our <a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/drift/">Drift Games</a> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">for tons of games similar to Drift Hunters Pro.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><figure class="post__featured-image"><img src="https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/Drift-Hunters-Pro.jpg" srcset="https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-xs.jpg 384w, https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-sm.jpg 600w, https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-md.jpg 768w, https://www.onlinegames.io/media/posts/397/responsive/Drift-Hunters-Pro-lg.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" loading="lazy" height="512" width="512" alt="Drift Hunters Pro Online"></figure></div><footer><p class="post__last-updated">This article was updated on November 15, 2025</p><div class="post__tags-share"><ul class="post__tag"><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/3d/">3D</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/car/">Car</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/crash/">Crash</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/drift/">Drift</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/driving/">Driving</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/embeddable-games-for-websites/">Embeddable</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/free/">Free</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/multiplayer/">Multiplayer</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/racing/">Racing</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/speed/">Speed</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/stunt/">Stunt</a></li><li><a href="https://www.onlinegames.io/t/unity/">Unity</a></li></ul></div></footer></div></article><script type="application/ld+json">{
